OL,3,GNEWSAHome-schooled 12-year-old's GCSEs
OL,4,Asuccess
OL,5,
OL,6,F"When I saw my results, I was
OL,7,Fexhilarated, and I was very happy to
OL,8,Fsee my entire family be proud of my
OL,9,Fsuccessful results."
OL,11,FAt only 12 years old, Ariel, who lives
OL,12,Fin Bicester has gained six GCSEs plus
OL,13,Fan advanced mathematics qualification
OL,14,Fover the past three years after being
OL,15,Fhome-schooled since the Covid pandemic.
OL,17,FIn 2024 as a 10-year-old Ariel passed
OL,18,Ftwo GCSEs with a nine in maths and
OL,19,Fchemistry. In 2025 she had two grade
OL,20,Fnines in Physics and Further Maths.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
