OL,3,GNEWSAHome-schooled 12-year-old's GCSEs
OL,4,Asuccess
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Thursday she added GCSE Biology
OL,7,F(grade 9), GCSE Further Pure
OL,8,FMathematics (grade 8) and an A grade in
OL,9,FOCR Additional Mathematics - an
OL,10,Fadvanced maths qualification that
OL,11,Fintroduces concepts usually studied
OL,12,Fbefore A-levels.
